asr-000605
00:58:31.620 --> 00:58:35.620
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: so that the center can be totally refurbished.

asr-000606
00:58:35.620 --> 00:58:39.920
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: Because the infection rate is quite high,

asr-000607
00:58:39.920 --> 00:58:46.820
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: given the fact that it is an old design, a dormitory design, post-World War II.

asr-000608
00:58:46.820 --> 00:58:52.180
DND Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.: And just like the DND proper building, it was molding.

asr-000609
00:58:52.180 --> 00:58:58.100
